{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Escape the daily routine and dive into a soothing hidden object adventure! Explore breathtaking outdoor locations\u2014from serene hiking trails and peaceful lakes to scenic horseback rides and cozy cabins. Test your observation skills as you search for hidden objects, solve captivating puzzles, and collect unique souvenirs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/5df0fcf453c6d4e68f57536bbb69ae6c.poster.avif?t=1772657571\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/5df0fcf453c6d4e68f57536bbb69ae6c.webm?t=1772657571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/5df0fcf453c6d4e68f57536bbb69ae6c.mp4?t=1772657571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Three Hidden Object Modes</strong> \u2013 Find items in different search styles to earn stars and unlock new areas.<br>\u2714 <strong>Challenging Mini-Games &amp; Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a variety of fun brain teasers.<br>\u2714 <strong>Collectible Souvenirs</strong> \u2013 Gather special keepsakes from your journey.<br>\u2714 <strong>Relaxing Bonus Content</strong> \u2013 Unlock wallpapers, a music player, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/e885a46b56c5ad23c99eb2e8394244f1.poster.avif?t=1772657571\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/e885a46b56c5ad23c99eb2e8394244f1.webm?t=1772657571\" type=\"